  "description": "Erection of a rear roof extension including a rear extension at second floor level over part of the existing back addition; erection of a single storey rear extension to the side of the existing back addition; excavation of the front and rear garden to form lightwells in connection with the enlargement of the existing basement; erection of a single storey garden shed in the rear garden; erection of a new front boundary wall with railings on top and installation of a pedestrian access gate to replace the existing boundary wall and gate; installation of an air conditioning unit with acoustic enclosure above the roof of second floor rear back addition; installation of 3no rooflights at main roof level; infilling of the existing windows to the side of rear back additions at first and second floor level and installation of a new window at the side of rear back addition at second floor level; installation of sliding doors to replace the existing door at ground floor level to the rear elevation; replacement of all existing single glazed timber framed windows with new double glazed timber framed windows and replacement of all external doors with new doors; alterations to external facade to include new brick window lintels to the rear, removal of external masonry paint and entrance wall tiles at the front; associated landscaping in the front and rear gardens.",
